In Stranglethorn Vale, a Gnome Warlock named Zephyr was on a quest to slay a powerful Succubus. The warlock had been warned that the Succubus was a powerful ally, but he was hesitant to take on the creature. Zephyr's succubus pet, a small, furry creature with a long tail, was a perfect match for the warlock's needs. The warlock decided to take on the Succubus, and Zephyr's pet was a crucial part of the battle. The warlock and his pet worked together to defeat the Succubus, and Zephyr was able to slay it with ease. The warlock was grateful to his pet for its help, and he was proud of his victory. [end of text]


